WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,160
Is your boss here?

2
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:07,230
I'm here to discuss business with him. Hello.

3
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:09,920
Yes, I have a phone number. I'll give it to you.

4
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:15,940
Little brother is young and promising

5
00:00:16,060 --> 00:00:17,820
Come and sit inside. It's so cold outside.

6
00:00:18,180 --> 00:00:21,900
Xiao Li, make two cups of tea to compare with Yang Feng

7
00:00:22,020 --> 00:00:25,670
I don’t know how to call Lin Yu

8
00:00:26,540 --> 00:00:28,740
I don’t know how much the Lin brothers are prepared to raise.

9
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:30,540
My store only needs money

10
00:00:30,580 --> 00:00:32,820
If you do a good job in publicity, you won't lose anything.

11
00:00:34,420 --> 00:00:35,540
I'm not here to raise money

12
00:00:36,910 --> 00:00:37,990
Not financing

13
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:39,740
Although I am not here to raise funds

14
00:00:39,940 --> 00:00:41,660
But I have a way to make your milk tea shop come alive
